{"title": "How to read a candle", "type": "Technical lesson", "hooks": ["Stop reading candles by colour. Read the 4 prices instead.", "Every chart is built from one shape. Read it in 4 prices.", "Every chart you will ever read is made of these."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop reading candles by colour. Read the 4 prices instead.", "text": "Read the 4 prices", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "One candle, four prices", "vo": "Each candle shows where price opened, where it closed, the highest point and the lowest point.", "items": [{"text": "Open", "sub": "where the candle started", "icon": "clock"}, {"text": "Close", "sub": "where it finished", "icon": "check"}, {"text": "High", "sub": "the top of the wick", "icon": "up"}, {"text": "Low", "sub": "the bottom of the wick", "icon": "down"}], "cues": [{"say": "opened", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "closed", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "highest point", "do": "item", "i": 2}, {"say": "lowest point", "do": "item", "i": 3}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Body and wicks", "show": 90, "vo": "The thick part is the body, from open to close. The thin lines are the wicks. Green closed higher than it opened. Red closed lower.", "cues": [{"say": "the body", "do": "zoom", "from": 70, "to": 82}, {"say": "Green closed higher", "do": "mark", "i": 73, "label": "G", "side": "low", "tone": "green"}, {"say": "Red closed lower", "do": "mark", "i": 80, "label": "R", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "A long upper wick", "show": 90, "vo": "Now this one. Buyers pushed price up, but sellers pushed it most of the way back. A long upper wick signals rejection from above.", "cues": [{"say": "this one", "do": "mark", "i": 77, "label": "W", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "One candle is a clue", "vo": "But one candle is a clue, not a signal. It means most at a level that matters, with volume.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Practise reading candles", "vo": "Practise reading candles on real game charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Stop reading candles by colour. Read the 4 prices instead.\n\nEach candle shows the open, the close, the high and the low. The body runs from open to close, and the wicks show the extremes.\n\nA long upper wick means buyers pushed up and sellers pushed it back.\n\nSave this for your next chart.\n\nPractise at memestreet.net\n\nFictional market. Not investment advice.\n\n#MemeStreet #Candlesticks #TechnicalAnalysis #LearnToTrade", "charts": [{"candles": [[40.93, 41.28, 40.91, 41.2, 2889], [41.2, 41.4, 41.14, 41.17, 16008], [41.18, 41.44, 40.56, 40.61, 31861], [40.61, 41.01, 40.57, 40.76, 17282], [40.76, 40.97, 40.58, 40.59, 18998], [40.59, 40.61, 40.21, 40.21, 30963], [40.21, 41.06, 40.15, 41.03, 28723], [41.04, 41.82, 40.62, 41.59, 42223], [41.59, 41.84, 41.05, 41.7, 33697], [41.69, 41.85, 41.31, 41.41, 20353], [41.4, 41.79, 41.27, 41.73, 13316], [41.73, 41.78, 41.29, 41.46, 18510], [41.46, 41.48, 41.26, 41.35, 9655], [41.35, 41.4, 41.1, 41.15, 13117], [41.15, 42.1, 41.11, 41.89, 14263], [41.89, 42.56, 41.65, 42.37, 8466], [42.37, 42.91, 42.29, 42.87, 3751], [42.88, 44.09, 42.6, 43.92, 13334], [43.92, 44.05, 43.52, 44.0, 9301], [44.0, 44.56, 43.72, 44.52, 12039], [44.52, 44.52, 43.03, 43.41, 17115], [43.4, 44.99, 43.37, 44.67, 13442], [44.67, 44.79, 41.87, 41.87, 11056], [41.92, 43.1, 40.96, 41.74, 25257], [41.75, 42.65, 41.59, 42.63, 9003], [42.63, 43.07, 42.37, 42.95, 9782], [42.95, 43.77, 42.9, 43.76, 10961], [43.77, 44.49, 43.54, 44.34, 8958], [44.34, 45.76, 44.24, 45.45, 9913], [45.46, 45.85, 45.14, 45.2, 22977], [45.16, 45.23, 43.6, 44.31, 31882], [44.33, 45.04, 40.6, 44.41, 133739], [44.42, 44.44, 40.97, 41.28, 81118], [41.29, 44.1, 41.29, 44.02, 47557], [43.99, 46.1, 43.93, 45.56, 35592], [45.55, 47.05, 44.7, 46.72, 31104], [46.68, 47.22, 46.64, 47.0, 12884], [47.0, 47.